{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事に今朝海外から帰って来ました〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの日本"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本は醤油の匂いがするよヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそのままお仕事だったのですが、みんなの顔を見てほっこりしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/15/7114197/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しい事はまた話すね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/15/7114197/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして１３日は乃木坂４６がブログを初めて一周年だった♪ヽ(´▽｀)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちあまり写メのせない子なのです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜなら普段すっぴんだし漫画も読みたいし!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって面白いんだもの〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/15/7114197/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん!!\nうちはこれからも時々マジメに語ったり、変なこと呟いたりしていきますのでぜひとも見てやってくだせぇや！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/15/7114197/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つー訳で今日は寝ますわ。\nおやすみなさい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"爆睡するもん寝っ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}